d specialised combat builds, and team up with your fellow Prospectors to raid enemy bases and push back the frontier.</p>","developers":["Payload Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2313330/header.jpg?t=1760536109","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Payload Studios","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313330/801846/66346298346a3750de05cb69dd24e6f3ac6fd34f/1750811469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1752500191","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313330/801846/66346298346a3750de05cb69dd24e6f3ac6fd34f/1750811469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1752500191","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313330/801846/66346298346a3750de05cb69dd24e6f3ac6fd34f/1750811469/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1752500191","id":257083154,"name":"TerraTech Worlds ","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257083154/66e71e9004941f2c796f58202716622a61a1debc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1752500191"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313330/677841/80320e6a4a9d741eba03c611bc6826fd446e5832/1750811469/dash_av1.mpd?t=1711030826","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2313330/677841/80320e6a4a9d741eba03c611bc6826fd446e5832/1750811469/dash_h264.mpd?t=1711030826","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor